{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rockwell\u2019s Night Watch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the sun dips each night in the woods outside of Scratchtail Hollow, Rockwell's cooler comes under attack. Mice, chipmunks, and more are after Rockwell\u2019s dinner\u2014and this old hound won\u2019t let it go without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Rockwell guard his cooler with the trusty CDS3000\u2122 and his own bark-and-growl defense. Collect treats from scared-off critters, then head into town to stock up on food, upgrades, and oddball gear. Meet neighbors, unlock new defenses, and see how long Rockwell can hold out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower-defense action with a rich story twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rockwell, a lovable hound with abilities that upgrade as the nights wear on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against waves of critters\u2014mice, chipmunks, and more to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treats to repair, upgrade, or buy gear in town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven progression across nights, with family and friends who drop by to lend help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo includes 25 nights of survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One last thing...I built this game as a way to heal from the loss of my canine best friend of so many years.\u00a0 With that in mind, a portion of the proceeds will go to support my favorite local dog rescue, Rural Dog Rescue .\u00a0 Consider donating today.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079310/extras/7ebfead722bb3f012dacbdd194fa5a16.avif?t=1761676572\" width=570 height=564 /></span></p><p 